flowchart LR
  subgraph railway [Railway]
    RWeb[Frontend service]
    RApi[API service]
    RMySQL[(MySQL plugin)]
    RRedis[(Redis plugin)]
  end

  subgraph k8s [Kubernetes / Helm]
    Ing[Ingress]
    FEPod[frontend pods]
    APIPod[api pods]
    KMySQL[(MySQL)]
    KRedis[(Redis)]
  end

  subgraph vercel [Vercel + hosted API]
    VWeb[Vercel Next.js]
    VApi[Hosted NestJS API]
  end

  User1[Users] --> RWeb
  RWeb --> RApi
  RApi --> RMySQL
  RApi --> RRedis

  User2[Users] --> Ing
  Ing --> FEPod
  Ing --> APIPod
  APIPod --> KMySQL
  APIPod --> KRedis

  User3[Users] --> VWeb
  VWeb --> VApi
